stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Auction.Create (POST /api/auctions)
    Pending --> Active: Activate(itemName, itemRarity, itemOfficialPrice) on ItemLockedEvent
    Pending --> Cancelled: Cancel(reason) on ItemLockRejectedEvent
    Active --> Active: ApplyNewBid (POST /api/auctions/{id}/bid), EndsOn += 30 s inside the anti-sniping window
    Active --> Closed: CloseAuction by AuctionCloser when EndsOn is in the past
    Closed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    note right of Pending
        any other transition throws
        InvalidAuctionStateTransitionException (409)
    end note
